#: main/wifi_page.c:241
msgid "The board takes the preferred AP while its signal is -75 dBm or better, else the strongest, and goes back to it within minutes when it is in range again (not for 30 min after the network moved the board). The network (DAWN) can still move it with 802.11v. Names are the same on every board: they are copied with the settings."
